{"id":"f12af111ab11110d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic.md","title":"IPC Theorem Set","display":"df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic — IPC Theorem Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic","aliases":["89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic"],"display":"df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic — IPC Theorem Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-ipc-language]]","[[89-df-ipc-proof-system]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-intuitionistic-propositional-logic — IPC Theorem Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2804e12c027228d4\" href=\"?note=2804e12c027228d4\" title=\"89-df-ipc-language\">89-df-ipc-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1c35d55817857e5\" href=\"?note=b1c35d55817857e5\" title=\"89-df-ipc-proof-system\">89-df-ipc-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 为本书字母集，将上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 参数实例化为此集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> is the intuitionistic propositional\nformula set from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2804e12c027228d4\" href=\"?note=2804e12c027228d4\" title=\"89-df-ipc-language\">89-df-ipc-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\)</span> is the natural-deduction derivability\nrelation generated by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b1c35d55817857e5\" href=\"?note=b1c35d55817857e5\" title=\"89-df-ipc-proof-system\">89-df-ipc-proof-system</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intuitionistic\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IPC}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\mid\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intuitionistic\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IPC}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\mid\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPC}\">\\(\\mathrm{IPC}\\)</span> 在这里是无假设可推导公式的集合，而不是一个未定型\n的“IPC 运算符”。</li>\n<li>该别名把跨书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> 统一成本书其余原子使用\n的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-ipc-language","status":"resolved","id":"2804e12c027228d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-ipc-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-ipc-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"b1c35d55817857e5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-ipc-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-ipc-language","status":"resolved","id":"2804e12c027228d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ is the intuitionistic propositional\nformula set from [[89-df-ipc-language]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-ipc-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"b1c35d55817857e5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A$ is the natural-deduction derivability\nrelation generated by [[89-df-ipc-proof-system]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intuitionistic\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IPC}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\mid\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}","display":false}],"bytes":1331,"backlink